  "You can sync data from all popular cloud storage providers to collect new items for labeling as they are uploaded, and return the annotation results to train and continuously improve models.": "可以从常用云存储同步新数据进行标注，再将标注结果用于训练和持续改进模型。",
  "There's an Enterprise version of Label Studio packed with more features and automation to label data faster while ensuring the highest quality.": "Label Studio 企业版提供更多功能和自动化能力，帮助团队提高标注效率与质量。",
  "Label Studio has dozens of pre-built templates for all data types you can use to configure your labeling UI, from image classification to sentiment analysis to supervised LLM fine-tuning. ": "Label Studio 提供多种数据类型的预置模板，可用于图像分类、情感分析和大语言模型监督微调等标注任务。",
  "Label Studio now has a Starter Cloud offering optimized for small teams and projects.": "Label Studio Starter Cloud 面向小型团队和项目提供云端服务。",
  "See all templates": "查看全部模板",
  "The number of days, after creation, that the token will be valid for. After this time period a user will need to create a new access token": "令牌自创建之日起的有效天数。到期后需要创建新的访问令牌。",
  "*Note: Currently, there is no built-in feedback loop within this interface for tracking the training progress. You'll need to monitor the model's training steps directly through the model's own tools and environment.": "注意：此界面目前不提供训练进度反馈，需要通过模型自身的工具和运行环境查看训练进度。",
  "A connected model has been detected! If you wish to fetch predictions from this model, please follow these steps:": "已检测到连接的模型。请按照以下步骤获取模型预测：",
  "A new annotation will be created and marked as ground truth.": "将创建新的标注，并将其设为真值标注。",
  "Add filter for long list of labels": "为较长的标签列表添加筛选器",
  "Adjust or remove filters to view": "调整或移除筛选条件以查看",
  "Adjust or remove the filters to view": "调整或移除筛选条件以查看",
  "again from the Regions panel.": "再次从区域面板中选择。",
